# SECURITY: never let real secrets (Azure Storage connection string, NextAuth/Azure AD
# credentials - see .env.example) get copied into the build context and baked into an image
# layer. Runtime config belongs in the container's environment (docker run -e / the hosting
# platform's application settings), not in the image itself.
